# Keep the build context small and free of host-built artefacts / secrets.
**/node_modules
.venv
**/.venv
**/.svelte-kit
**/build
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.moon/cache
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache

# interlace's local control plane: state/stream SQLite plus its query cache — a developer's
# own sync state, and the .bak copies taken around a production run. Git ignores it, so a
# clean clone has none, but Docker reads the FILESYSTEM: a laptop build was baking local (and
# production) state into the image while CI's was empty, which is precisely how the seccl
# service came to depend on a directory that only existed on one machine. The container
# creates the directory itself (services/seccl/Dockerfile).
**/.interlace

# VCS / CI / docs are not needed to build the images — except the small
# anonymised Seccl lake fixture, which the API image ships (see apps/api/
# Dockerfile). NB: `docs/*` (not `docs`) so the fixture can be re-included;
# Docker can't re-include a file whose parent dir is wholly excluded. This also
# keeps the git-ignored real extract (docs/*.real.duckdb) out of the context.
.git
.github
docs/*
!docs/seccl.duckdb

# pkgs/{seccl,sei,morgan-lloyd}/spec and /scripts are build-time-only (vendored API specs, the
# manifest/schema generator scripts that read them) — nothing under src/ imports either at
# runtime. Excluding them keeps the vendored 8.2MB Postman collection at pkgs/seccl/spec out of
# apps/api/Dockerfile and Dockerfile.worker's runtime images, which COPY these packages' whole
# trees (workspace `{ workspace = true }` sources need the tree present for `uv sync`, not just
# the src/ half).
pkgs/*/spec
pkgs/*/scripts

# Never bake env files into an image (only *.example is safe, but unneeded)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# intelliflo-sync's local-only seed fixtures (tenant/account identifiers for a developer's own
# Intelliflo sandbox) — `local.yaml`, not `local.example.yaml`. Nothing at runtime imports the
# seed script either, but the image build still COPYs the service's whole tree.
**/migrations/*/seeds/local.yaml

# Misc
**/*.timestamp-*.mjs
**/*.log
.DS_Store
apps/api/openapi.json
